type: software
title: "Dilated AF (Dilated Aorta Finder)"
abstract: >-
  Height-indexed reference values for the aortic root and proximal
  ascending aorta (NORRE, WASE), with lower and upper limits,
  percent of expected, z-scores, and copy-ready report text.
authors:
  - family-names: Dyar
    given-names: Dan
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
url: "https://parameterz.github.io/dilated-af/"
